{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Pawblem Careline</strong>, you\u2019ll become the exclusive customer service agent for cats, handling complaints and requests from various felines:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483950/extras/steam_pawblemcareline_2.png?t=1740489302\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each choice you make will open a different badge from the customer service card pack. Every cat has its own unique badge for players to collect. Additionally, there are special calls and exclusive badges from mysterious characters every day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483950/extras/steam_pawblemcareline_10.png?t=1740489302\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each round of calls, players can sell their collected badges to anonymous sellers in the market, helping to save this hotline service company that\u2019s dedicated to cats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483950/extras/steam_pawblemcareline_9.png?t=1740489302\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can choose to accumulate badges and unlock photos to decorate their collection board. Every time a photo is completed, it will reveal a part of the cat character\u2019s backstory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483950/extras/steam_pawblemcareline_8.png?t=1740489302\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3483950?t=1740489302","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483950/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740489302","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483950/36f98ee6fda548ba0ad940cc39f7f19e7c78f1ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740489302","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483950/36f98ee6fda548ba0ad940cc39f7f19e7c78f1ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740489302","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Pawblem Careline</strong>, you\u2019ll become the exclusive customer service agent for cats, handling complaints and requests from various felines:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483950/extras/steam_pawblemcareline_2.png?t=1740489302\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each choice you make will open a different badge from the customer service card pack. Every cat has its own unique badge for players to collect. Additionally, there are special calls and exclusive badges from mysterious characters every day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483950/extras/steam_pawblemcareline_10.png?t=1740489302\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each round of calls, players can sell their collected badges to anonymous sellers in the market, helping to save this hotline service company that\u2019s dedicated to cats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483950/extras/steam_pawblemcareline_9.png?t=1740489302\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can choose to accumulate badges and unlock photos to decorate their collection board. Every time a photo is completed, it will reveal a part of the cat character\u2019s backstory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483950/extras/steam_pawblemcareline_8.png?t=1740489302\" /></p>","